= container-tab-bar selected='custom-domain' model=model
.card-body
  p.message
    | Custom domain support is automatically enabled for your plan. Simply create a
    '
    code CNAME
    |  record pointing your subdomain to
    '
    code.primary #{previewHostname}
    | . You will be able to access your container via this custom subdomain once DNS has propagrated
    |  (~24 hours after creating your container).

  p.hint-text
    i.fa.fa-info-circle
    | Custom domain support is not available for apex domains (e.g.
    '
    code example.com
    | ). Please use a subdomain (e.g.
    '
    code www.example.com
    | ).